{
  "headline": "Net Revenue fell 11.2% (Rs 1,65,085) in the week of 1 Aug 2026.",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Evaluating daily Net Revenue data between 1 Aug 2026 and 7 Aug 2026 against the prior window reveals a verified headline drop of 11.2% (Rs 1,65,085).",
      "tier_from": "headline"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localization tests identify that the drop concentrated in the Smart Home category on the Web channel, representing 112.4% of the overall KPI drop across a support size of 67.",
      "tier_from": "localization[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A second concentration appears in Smart Home within the South region, accounting for 62.7% of the overall KPI drop with a support size of 55.",
      "tier_from": "localization[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mathematical decomposition indicates that volume reduction contributed 92.4% of the total revenue drop (Rs 1,48,528).",
      "tier_from": "decomposition"
    },
    {
      "text": "Price decreases contributed 9.8% to the total revenue drop (Rs 15,816), whereas product mix exerted a mild positive effect of -2.2% (Rs 3,528).",
      "tier_from": "decomposition"
    },
    {
      "text": "A primary hypothesis segmenting Smart Home on the Web channel survived difference-in-differences testing with a treated shift of -31.1% versus 0.0% in control.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The primary segment also survived placebo timing checks with a -14.7 percentage point difference-in-difference against a 2.0 percentage point noise standard deviation.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rival hypothesis examining general Web channel movement survived testing as well, moving -31.1% in the treated group compared to 7.1% in control.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A potential confound hypothesis for broader Smart Home category movement was rejected due to a magnitude mismatch, as the rival scope moved 7.0% compared to the segment's 31.1% reduction.",
      "tier_from": "rejected_hypotheses[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finance Operations is tasked with evaluating the paid_marketing_spend lever targeting the localized segment to attempt recovering Rs 1,65,085.",
      "tier_from": "action"
    },
    {
      "text": "Performance monitoring on Net Revenue is scheduled after 14 days to confirm whether the segment recovers toward baseline expectations.",
      "tier_from": "action"
    }
  ]
}
